-- a wrong name
verifier: platform, asked for the OS's verdict: 1
handshake done: client no, server no
client's error: quic: the server's certificate was refused by the OS's verifier: hostname mismatch (OpenSSL's verify result 62) (ERR_CRYPTO)
...the verifier's error, as a kind: certificate name mismatch
the server heard the close: code 296, TLS alert 40
